  <bpmn:process id="visitor-process" name="A visitor, signed out" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Anybody who opens the map without an account. Nearly everything works for them: the map, the chat, saving, reading lists and profiles, feedback. What they meet a sign-in for is a discount code and keeping somebody else's list.</bpmn:documentation>
